# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECRETS — this repository is PUBLIC and is deployed for multiple groups.
# Credentials are DATABASE-DRIVEN (encrypted settings + per-instance integration
# records). Nothing secret belongs in git, including in documentation.
#
# If a value would let someone act as this install, it is not documentation.
# Use a placeholder such as <PRESCRIBE_RX_API_TOKEN>.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Environment — every variant. .env.example is the ONLY tracked env file and
# must contain placeholders only.
